  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u445c8d92\" id=\"u445c8d92\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc646eb6d\" id=\"uc646eb6d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">参考文档：</span><card type=\"inline\" name=\"bookmarkInline\" value=\"data:%7B%22mode%22%3A%22title%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.espressif.com%2Fprojects%2Fesp-idf%2Fzh_CN%2Fstable%2Fesp32s3%2Fapi-reference%2Fperipherals%2Fledc.html%23_CPPv4N21ledc_channel_config_t5flagsE%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.espressif.com%2Fprojects%2Fesp-idf%2Fzh_CN%2Fstable%2Fesp32s3%2Fapi-reference%2Fperipherals%2Fledc.html%23_CPPv4N21ledc_channel_config_t5flagsE%22%2C%22detail%22%3A%7B%22icon%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.espressif.com%2Ffavicon.ico%22%2C%22image%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.espressif.com%2Fprojects%2Fesp-idf%2Fzh_CN%2Fstable%2Fesp32s3%2F_static%2Fespressif-logo.svg%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22LED%20PWM%20%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%20-%20ESP32-S3%20-%20%E2%80%94%20ESP-IDF%20%E7%BC%96%E7%A8%8B%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%20v5.2.3%20%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3%22%2C%22belong%22%3A%22%E2%80%94%20ESP-IDF%20%E7%BC%96%E7%A8%8B%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%20v5.2.3%20%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3%22%2C%22belong_url%22%3Anull%2C%22desc%22%3Anull%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.espressif.com%2Fprojects%2Fesp-idf%2Fzh_CN%2Fstable%2Fesp32s3%2Fapi-reference%2Fperipherals%2Fledc.html%23_CPPv4N21ledc_channel_config_t5flagsE%22%2C%22extra%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22_serializer%22%3A%22web.editor_link_detail%22%7D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lKSna%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2df40de2\" id=\"u2df40de2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1ea45fad\" id=\"u1ea45fad\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u910a4ed9\" id=\"u910a4ed9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud4b8e043\" id=\"ud4b8e043\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">LED 控制器 (LEDC) 主要用于控制 LED，也可产生 PWM 信号用于其他设备的控制。该控制器有 8 路通道，可以产生独立的波形，驱动 RGB LED 等设备。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud13f9fde\" id=\"ud13f9fde\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc638c100\" id=\"uc638c100\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">LED PWM 控制器可在无需 CPU 干预的情况下自动改变占空比，实现亮度和颜色渐变。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8d7fd071\" id=\"u8d7fd071\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf4d077ff\" id=\"uf4d077ff\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">参见：</span><a href=\"https://docs.espressif.com/projects/esp-idf/zh_CN/stable/esp32s3/api-reference/peripherals/ledc.html#id12\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u22664cfa\" id=\"u22664cfa\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0bfbf9a9\" id=\"u0bfbf9a9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">https://docs.espressif.com/projects/esp-idf/zh_CN/stable/esp32s3/api-reference/peripherals/ledc.html#id12</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud3969abd\" id=\"ud3969abd\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"iZgDe\" id=\"iZgDe\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u08fa37db\" id=\"u08fa37db\">定时器配置</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20%E5%AE%9A%E6%97%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%5Cn%20%20%20%20ledc_timer_config_t%20%20pwm_config%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.clk_cfg%20%3D%20LEDC_AUTO_CLK%20%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.duty_resolution%20%3D%20LEDC_TIMER_13_BIT%20%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.freq_hz%20%3D%201000%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.speed_mode%20%3D%20LEDC_LOW_SPEED_MODE%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.timer_num%20%3D%20LEDC_TIMER_0%2C%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20ledc_timer_config(%26pwm_config)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vB1DY%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"WrIXo\" id=\"WrIXo\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud35adb73\" id=\"ud35adb73\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">通道配置</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u3c766b25\" id=\"u3c766b25\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%20%2F%2F%20%E9%80%9A%E9%81%93%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%5Cn%20%20%20%20ledc_channel_config_t%20channel_config%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.channel%20%3D%20LEDC_CHANNEL_0%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.duty%20%3D%204096%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.gpio_num%20%3D%2048%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.intr_type%20%3D%20LEDC_INTR_DISABLE%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.speed_mode%20%3D%20LEDC_LOW_SPEED_MODE%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.timer_sel%20%3D%20LEDC_TIMER_0%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20ledc_channel_config(%26channel_config)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22B6LUq%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"udb6f46c4\" id=\"udb6f46c4\"><code data-lake-id=\"u11ca0583\" id=\"u11ca0583\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7621d7e4\" id=\"u7621d7e4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--vp-code-color)\">hpoint</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uec81e87b\" id=\"uec81e87b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(60, 60, 67)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u51dac9dc\" id=\"u51dac9dc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(60, 60, 67)\">：<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u03d38409\" id=\"u03d38409\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(60, 60, 67)\">led通道 hpoint 值。hpoint 叫做占空比作用点。它表示占空比对应的时钟计数值。所谓占空比作用点，表示LEDC模块在输出PWM信号的过程中，会根据计数器和占空比值比较得出一个结果，将其与hpoint进行比较，然后输出PWM信号，具体操作如下：</span></p><ul list=\"ud9c52265\"><li fid=\"u4409bffc\" data-lake-id=\"u50caedb0\" id=\"u50caedb0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u02f2e796\" id=\"u02f2e796\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(60, 60, 67)\">如果计数器值小于hpoint，LEDC模块的PWM信号输出为逻辑高电平。</span></li><li fid=\"u4409bffc\" data-lake-id=\"u2c72651b\" id=\"u2c72651b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3a3c1ef8\" id=\"u3a3c1ef8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(60, 60, 67)\">如果计数器值大于等于hpoint，LEDC模块的PWM信号输出为逻辑低电平。</span></li><li fid=\"u4409bffc\" data-lake-id=\"u0a0f6dc3\" id=\"u0a0f6dc3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u673d0bd8\" id=\"u673d0bd8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(60, 60, 67)\">当计数器达到最大值（0xfffff）时，LEDC模块会将计数值清零并将PWM信号输出为逻辑低电平。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u2bd29332\" id=\"u2bd29332\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud28a1b90\" id=\"ud28a1b90\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(60, 60, 67)\">因此</span></p><ul list=\"u22062569\"><li fid=\"u235a481a\" data-lake-id=\"u9ae3669b\" id=\"u9ae3669b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u06befa37\" id=\"u06befa37\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(60, 60, 67)\">hpoint值越小：设置的duty越小，输出PWM信号时占空比也就越小</span></li><li fid=\"u235a481a\" data-lake-id=\"ub5329473\" id=\"ub5329473\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc5561e80\" id=\"uc5561e80\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(60, 60, 67)\">hpoint值越大，设置的duty越大，输出PWM信号时占空比也就越大。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ucb31f8b2\" id=\"ucb31f8b2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue8d91501\" id=\"ue8d91501\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(60, 60, 67)\">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"Xlmk7\" id=\"Xlmk7\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubb7c18e3\" id=\"ubb7c18e3\" style=\"color: rgb(60, 60, 67)\">参考代码</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"FB1lK\" id=\"FB1lK\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3fc0c585\" id=\"u3fc0c585\">导入头文件</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%23include%20%5C%22esp_log.h%5C%22%5Cn%23include%20%5C%22driver%2Fledc.h%5C%22%5Cn%23include%20%5C%22freertos%2FFreeRTOS.h%5C%22%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%AD%A4%E5%A4%84%E9%A1%BA%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E9%94%99%5Cn%23include%20%5C%22freertos%2Ftask.h%5C%22%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ymx6b%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"W6ae6\" id=\"W6ae6\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4475f3cf\" id=\"u4475f3cf\">初始化引脚</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22static%20void%20example_pwm_ledc_init()%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%AE%9A%E6%97%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%5Cn%20%20%20%20ledc_timer_config_t%20%20pwm_config%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.clk_cfg%20%3D%20LEDC_AUTO_CLK%20%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.duty_resolution%20%3D%20LEDC_TIMER_13_BIT%20%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.freq_hz%20%3D%201000%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.speed_mode%20%3D%20LEDC_LOW_SPEED_MODE%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.timer_num%20%3D%20LEDC_TIMER_0%2C%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20ledc_timer_config(%26pwm_config)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E9%80%9A%E9%81%93%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%5Cn%20%20%20%20ledc_channel_config_t%20channel_config%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.channel%20%3D%20LEDC_CHANNEL_0%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.duty%20%3D%204096%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.gpio_num%20%3D%2048%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.intr_type%20%3D%20LEDC_INTR_DISABLE%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.speed_mode%20%3D%20LEDC_LOW_SPEED_MODE%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.timer_sel%20%3D%20LEDC_TIMER_0%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20ledc_channel_config(%26channel_config)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QKQyV%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"ppQG9\" id=\"ppQG9\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1752e307\" id=\"u1752e307\">测试函数</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u7b7cf21f\" id=\"u7b7cf21f\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22void%20example_pwm_ledc_test()%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20pwm%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%5Cn%20%20%20%20example_pwm_ledc_init()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%8D%A0%E7%A9%BA%E6%AF%94%5Cn%20%20%20%20uint32_t%20i%20%3D%200%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20while(1)%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20ledc_set_duty(LEDC_TIMER_0%2CLEDC_CHANNEL_0%2Ci)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20ledc_update_duty(LEDC_TIMER_0%2CLEDC_CHANNEL_0)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20vTaskDelay(pdMS_TO_TICKS(10))%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20i%2B%3D100%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if(i%20%3E%208192)%20i%20%3D%200%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oWrUN%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card>",
